# Deny by default, then name exactly what the image needs. The build context
# is this folder (`rle/`) itself -- `azd ai rle publish` always builds from
# the directory holding rle.toml, so these paths are relative to here, not
# the sample root. This allowlist exists to keep tests, docs and local cruft
# out of the image.
**
!requirements.txt
!__init__.py
!server/
!server/*.py
!server/tasks/
!server/tasks/*.py
!server/tasks/task-meta/
!server/tasks/task-meta/*.json.gz
# Re-deny bytecode cache the allowlist above would otherwise sweep in from a
# local working tree (it is gitignored, not git-excluded from the build).
**/__pycache__
